      "sourceTextSha256": "b23e4985b32d9191061f4a6a63ac3e73acc5f56dbf057369e2ed0a160b021505",
      "text": "Arrival in Rio de Janeiro, where we meet you at the airport and drive you to your hotel to rest after the long flight. On the way, you will be enchanted by the scenery: green mountains, tall palm trees and the emerald ocean; at dusk, the lights around Rio sparkle like a necklace.\n\nRio awaits with the endless blue ocean, soft sand and remarkable natural beauty; in the cosy cafés along its famous beaches you can try all kinds of drinks made from juicy tropical fruits.",
